{"id":"level-up-2026-09-18","name":"2026-09-18 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s101","en":"She chose to study microbiology after visiting a research laboratory.","zh":"参观一家研究实验室后，她选择学习微生物学。","note":"microbiology · 微生物学 · study microbiology","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s102","en":"The old harbour has become a magnet for young artists.","zh":"老港口已成为吸引年轻艺术家的地方。","note":"magnet · 磁铁， 磁石； 磁体； 有吸引力的人或物 · a powerful magnet","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s103","en":"The trial run helped expose weaknesses in our booking system.","zh":"试运行帮助暴露了我们预订系统中的弱点。","note":"expose · 使暴露， 揭露 · expose a weakness","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s104","en":"This versatile tool can cut cardboard and open paint tins.","zh":"这个多用途工具可以切纸板，也能开油漆罐。","note":"versatile · 多才多艺的， 多面手的； 多用途的， 通用的 · a versatile tool","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s105","en":"I find it difficult to concentrate when music is playing.","zh":"播放音乐时，我很难集中注意力。","note":"concentrate · 全神贯注，全力以赴；集中，聚集；浓缩；浓缩物， 浓缩液 · concentrate on work","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s106","en":"The seminar explored quality versus quantity in modern food production.","zh":"研讨会探讨了现代食品生产中质量与数量的取舍。","note":"versus · 与…相对， 对抗 · quality versus quantity","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s107","en":"Several species of seabird populate the island during summer.","zh":"夏季，岛上栖息着几种海鸟。","note":"populate · 居住于， 生活于 · populate an island","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s108","en":"The website provides up-to-date information about local bus services.","zh":"该网站提供有关当地公交服务的最新信息。","note":"up-to-date · 直到最近的； 现代的 · up-to-date information","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s109","en":"The guide recommends several walking routes suitable for young children.","zh":"指南推荐了几条适合幼童的步行路线。","note":"suitable · 适当的， 相配的； 合适的， 适宜的 · suitable for children","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s110","en":"Only trained personnel may operate the equipment in this workshop.","zh":"只有受过培训的人员才能操作这间车间的设备。","note":"personnel · 全体人员， 员工 · trained personnel","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s111","en":"Please do not splash water onto the freshly painted wall.","zh":"请别把水溅到刚刷好的墙上。","note":"splash · 溅； 泼 · splash water","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s112","en":"Despite recent setbacks, the team maintains an optimistic outlook.","zh":"尽管最近遇到挫折，团队仍保持乐观的态度。","note":"outlook · 观点， 见解； 展望， 前景 · an optimistic outlook","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s113","en":"Their holiday romance developed into a lasting relationship after university.","zh":"他们假期中的恋情在大学毕业后发展成了长久的伴侣关系。","note":"romance · 恋爱； 浪漫爱情； 爱情小说， 传奇故事 · a holiday romance","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s114","en":"There is a drinking fountain beside the park entrance.","zh":"公园入口旁有一个饮水台。","note":"fountain · 喷泉 · a drinking fountain","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s115","en":"Remove irrelevant details so readers can follow your main argument.","zh":"删去不相关的细节，让读者能跟上你的主要论点。","note":"irrelevant · 不相关的； 离题的 · irrelevant details","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s116","en":"This little gadget helps me remove lids from tight jars.","zh":"这个小工具帮助我打开拧得很紧的罐子盖。","note":"gadget · 小巧的器械， 精巧的装置； 小玩意 · a useful gadget","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s117","en":"Abroad, she was delighted to meet a compatriot from her hometown.","zh":"在国外，她很高兴遇到一位来自家乡的同胞。","note":"compatriot · 同胞； 同国人 · meet a compatriot","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s118","en":"One practical implication is that schools may need larger classrooms.","zh":"一个实际影响是，学校可能需要更大的教室。","note":"implication · 含意； 暗示， 暗指； 卷入， 牵连 · a practical implication","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s119","en":"Small bookshops face fierce competition from large online retailers.","zh":"小书店面临来自大型网络零售商的激烈竞争。","note":"fierce · 凶猛的； 强烈的 · fierce competition","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s120","en":"I called the restaurant to make a reservation for Saturday.","zh":"我打电话给餐厅预订周六的座位。","note":"reservation · 保留意见， 存疑； 预定， 预订 · make a reservation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s121","en":"Please move your bicycle so it does not block the entrance.","zh":"请把自行车移开，别挡住入口。","note":"block · 一排房屋，街区；阻塞；大块木料；阻塞， 拦阻； 封锁 · block the entrance","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s122","en":"The caretaker showed us the fire extinguisher beside the kitchen.","zh":"管理员指给我们看厨房旁的灭火器。","note":"extinguisher · 灭火器； 灭火者 · a fire extinguisher","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s123","en":"The exhibition succeeded through close cooperation between artists and local schools.","zh":"艺术家与当地学校密切合作，使展览取得了成功。","note":"cooperation · 合作， 协作； 配合 · close cooperation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s124","en":"The timid child gradually joined the others around the table.","zh":"那个胆怯的孩子渐渐加入了桌边其他孩子的活动。","note":"timid · 胆小的； 羞怯的 · a timid child","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s125","en":"The committee will propose a solution at tomorrow's meeting.","zh":"委员会将在明天的会议上提出解决方案。","note":"propose · 提议， 建议； 提名， 推荐； 打算； 求婚 · propose a solution","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s126","en":"This room feels spacious in comparison with my old bedroom.","zh":"与我以前的卧室相比，这个房间显得宽敞。","note":"in comparison with · 与…比较，同…比较起来 · in comparison with","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s127","en":"The farmer allowed one field to lie fallow this year.","zh":"农民今年让一块田地休耕。","note":"fallow · 休耕的； 休闲的 · lie fallow","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s128","en":"The island plans to generate more electricity from renewable energy.","zh":"该岛计划利用可再生能源生产更多电力。","note":"renewable · 可更新的， 可再生的， 可恢复的； 可延长有效期的， 可续期的 · renewable energy","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s129","en":"The novel's charming stranger gradually reveals his malevolent intentions.","zh":"小说中那位迷人的陌生人逐渐暴露出恶意。","note":"malevolent · 有恶意的； 恶毒的 · malevolent intentions","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s130","en":"When the lights suddenly failed, confusion began to ensue.","zh":"灯突然熄灭后，混乱随之出现。","note":"ensue · 继而发生； 接着发生 · chaos ensues","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s131","en":"The library will remain closed for the foreseeable future.","zh":"在可预见的将来，图书馆仍将关闭。","note":"foreseeable · 可预知的， 能预测的 · the foreseeable future","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s132","en":"Our coach encouraged us to practise passing before the match.","zh":"教练鼓励我们在比赛前练习传球。","note":"coach · 教练；指导；长途汽车；训练； 辅导 · a football coach","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s133","en":"During her first term abroad, she began to pine for home.","zh":"在国外的第一个学期，她开始苦苦思念家乡。","note":"pine · 难过， · pine for home","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s134","en":"We waited beside the baggage carousel for our suitcases.","zh":"我们在行李传送带旁等候行李箱。","note":"carousel · 行李式传送带 · a baggage carousel","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s135","en":"The irony was that our quietest colleague won the debating competition.","zh":"出人意料的是，最沉默的同事赢得了辩论赛。","note":"irony · 反话， 讽刺； 出人意料的事情 · a sense of irony","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s136","en":"The artist built a garden sculpture from scrap metal.","zh":"艺术家用废金属制作了一座花园雕塑。","note":"scrap · 碎屑；废弃； 抛弃 · scrap metal","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s137","en":"The museum runs workshops in conjunction with local schools.","zh":"博物馆与当地学校合作举办工作坊。","note":"conjunction · 连接； 连词 · in conjunction with","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s138","en":"The historian compared cameral procedures in two early European parliaments.","zh":"历史学家比较了两个早期欧洲议会的议院程序。","note":"cameral · 院的 · cameral procedure","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s139","en":"We crossed a meadow filled with yellow spring flowers.","zh":"我们穿过了一片开满黄色春花的草地。","note":"meadow · 草地 · a wildflower meadow","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s140","en":"I usually roast vegetables while the soup cooks slowly.","zh":"我通常在汤慢慢煮着的时候烤蔬菜。","note":"roast · 烤过的；烤， 炙；烤肉 · roast vegetables","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s141","en":"Three buses arrived in quick succession after a long wait.","zh":"等了很久后，三辆公交车接连到达。","note":"succession · 连续； 接替， 继承 · in quick succession","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s142","en":"The crew had to haul equipment up the steep path.","zh":"队员们不得不沿着陡峭的小路费力搬运设备。","note":"haul · 用力拖； 搬运 · haul equipment","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s143","en":"The dancers gave an energetic performance despite the afternoon heat.","zh":"尽管下午很热，舞者们仍带来了活力十足的表演。","note":"energetic · 有力的， 精力旺盛的； 积极的 · an energetic performance","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s144","en":"We searched every drawer for the missing key, to no avail.","zh":"我们搜遍每个抽屉寻找丢失的钥匙，却一无所获。","note":"avail · 有帮助，有益， · to no avail","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s145","en":"Better stock planning can reduce food wastage in school kitchens.","zh":"更好的库存规划能减少学校厨房的食物损耗。","note":"wastage · 消耗量； 损耗； 减员 · reduce wastage","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s146","en":"Growing the same crop repeatedly can impoverish the soil.","zh":"反复种植同一种作物可能使土壤变得贫瘠。","note":"impoverish · 使贫困； 使枯竭， 使贫瘠 · impoverish the soil","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-18:s147","en":"The programme attracts musicians of exceptionally high calibre each year.","zh":"这个项目每年吸引水平极高的音乐家。","note":"calibre · 质量， 才干， 能力； 口径 · of high calibre","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-1